  "window": "The scene plays assets/transitions/SCENE_ID.mp4 (16 frames): make_scene writes that path when it renames the scene, so bake that exact file with the recipe before rendering. It is not a variable: HyperFrames only extracts video frames from a src written in the file (a src bound with data-var-src renders blank), and make_scene checks file variables before it renames the scene.",
